# Personal OS

Modules must not become isolated apps. Every write emits an `ActivityEvent` via `ActivityBus`.

Fitness copy is hedged only: "You marked shoulder discomfort", "Possible plateau", "Consider a lighter week". No medical claims. No body-composition analysis.

Journal bodies are ciphertext + IV. Progress photos are auth-gated, not public URLs.

Quick-log is speech-to-text plus deterministic parsing in `shared/nlp`. No autonomous agent loop.

Demo seed user is Kristijan (level 18, 12-day streak) matching the landing/dashboard mockup.
